===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/dɪsˈdʒʌŋk(t)ʃən/|/dɪsˈdʒʊŋk(t)ʃən/|lang=en}}
*: {{rhymes|ʌŋkʃən|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# act of [[disjoin]]ing; [[disunion]], [[separation]]
# [[state]] of being [[disjoined]]
# {{lb|en|logic}} The [[proposition]] resulting from the combination of two or more propositions using the [[or]] [[operator]].
# {{lb|en|mathematics}} a [[logical operator]] that results in [[true]] when some of its [[operands]] are true.
# {{lb|en|biology}} During meiosis, the separation of chromosomes (homologous in meiosis I, and sister chromatids in meiosis II).

